---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Terms of use – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Publisher, host, intended use, limits of liability, intellectual property and governing law for My Canada Benefits, an independent site of Canadian benefit and pension calculators." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Terms of use' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Person responsible for the content published on {SITE_URL}: {AUTHOR_NAME}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>What the site is for</h2>
    <p>The site offers free calculators and guides on Canadian federal and provincial benefits and public pensions, built from the amounts published by the Government of Canada, the provinces and Retraite Québec. Results are <strong>estimates</strong> computed from what you enter. They are not a decision, financial or legal advice, or a promise of payment. Only the CRA, Service Canada, Retraite Québec or the province concerned decides an entitlement. The site is independent, is not affiliated with any government, and uses no government logo or visual identity. Method and limits: <a href={route('method', lang)}>calculation method</a>.</p>
    <h2>Limits of liability</h2>
    <p>Parameters are re-read against their sources at each benefit-year and quarterly change and the engine is checked by automated tests, but no error-free result is guaranteed. The publisher is not liable for a decision taken on the strength of an estimate alone. Report an error through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Text, design and code belong to the publisher; short quotations are welcome with a link to the page. Government of Canada information is reproduced in line with the federal non-commercial reproduction terms, and official documents are linked rather than copied.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2><p>The household benefits calculator may be embedded free of charge in an iframe, with its credit link kept visible: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Reporting content</h2><p>Unlawful or misleading content: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, with the page address and the reason.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>These terms are governed by French law, the publisher’s place of establishment, without prejudice to the mandatory consumer protections of your province of residence. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
